## prefix.cc prefixes

`assets/prefixes.json` is the list of popular prefixes published by
[prefix.cc](https://prefix.cc) (`https://prefix.cc/popular/all.file.json`).
The build fetches the current list and embeds it in the binary to shorten
IRIs, falling back to the committed copy when prefix.cc cannot be reached.

## W3C SHACL test suite

`tests/w3c` holds tests from the [W3C SHACL test suite](https://w3c.github.io/data-shapes/data-shapes-test-suite/)
under the W3C Software and Document License (`tests/w3c/LICENSE.md`). They are
only used by the tests and are not part of the binary.

